Language Detection
Definition

Language Detection is the process of identifying the language in which a given text is written.

Examples
Input Text	Detected Language
Good Morning	English
Bonjour	French
Hola	Spanish
ನಮಸ್ಕಾರ	Kannada
வணக்கம்	Tamil
Application in UiPath

A company may receive emails in different languages. 
UiPath can use a Language Detection ML model to identify the language and automatically 
route the email to the appropriate support team.

